Depends: git, libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libgl1, libegl1
Recommends: python3-nautilus, libwayland-client0, fonts-dejavu-core
Section: vcs
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/alexeylovchikov/refbraid
Description: Git history, branches and commits in one window
 RefBraid shows the commit graph, branches, changes and diffs of a Git
 repository and lets you commit, push, pull, merge, rebase and more.
 Open a folder from Files (Nautilus): right-click it, then "Open With" or
 "Open in RefBraid".
